## Quick Start

### Prerequisites

- Python 3.10+
<% if (patterns.includes('database')) { %>
- PostgreSQL
<% } %>
<% if (patterns.includes('cache')) { %>
- Redis
<% } %>
- Docker & Docker Compose (optional)

### Installation

```bash
# Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/<%= projectName %>.git
cd <%= projectName %>

# Install dependencies
make install

# Start development environment
make dev
```

### Running with Docker

```bash
# Start all services
make docker-up

# View logs
make docker-logs

# Stop services
make docker-down
```

